{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","祖娅"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名擅长制造机械装置的射手，能够在战斗中额外布置机械塔。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","炮塔设置完毕"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Turrets locked and loaded!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","迭代成功！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","This tweak did the trick!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","联合发射！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Take a hint!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","出现漏洞，必须修复……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Oh... a loophole... I need to fix that..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","啊哈，第一！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Ha! I'm number one!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","创意、思考、实践！"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","Tinker... test... and build!"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","枪身……完美 瞄准——啾！呼……完美！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","So annoying... Good thing you're reliable."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","嗯？哪里……哦！好了！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Oh! Where is it? Ah okay, got it."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","嗯，哪里，哎，好了。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这太棒了！我充满了灵感！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","哇哦，谢谢！我很喜欢！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这儿挺适合搞发明啊！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","这个地方的开关可以这样……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","来喝点不含酒精的吧！"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","祖娅的头发是自己编的，多年来，她换过许多次发型，但目前这种最好打理。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","祖娅并不是全才，对于矿产、冶炼、建筑等方面，她只是大体了解，她的专业在于机械、材料以及相关研发。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","祖娅比起大部分发明家来说，最出色的一点是，她的灵感有大半都能成功地落地实现。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","尽管祖娅大部分时间都闷在实验室里独自工作，但她实际上很擅长工程项目的组织、管理和排期，她甚至可以单独管理三条采矿队。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","无论活了多久，祖娅始终会抽时间学习最新技术。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","尽管无法使用魔法，但祖娅记录过大部分魔法能够达到的效果，甚至很多年轻的魔法师都比不过她的知识积累。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","祖娅曾经收过不少学生，以前还开过教学班和专属讲座，但她表示，目前为止，呼金是她最出色的弟子。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","尽管经历了漫长的岁月，但祖娅的性格却仍然保留着年轻人热情积极的那一面，或许这就是创造带来的活力。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","祖娅并不是特别热衷于旅行，但她年轻的时候也在大陆各地辗转过许多年——这些经历让她的技艺融入了各地特色。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","祖娅习惯于更换身份，但名字基本上不变——主要是因为她确实很不擅长文字工作。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，你是怎么认识呼金这小子的？"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep4/herohub_story/14411040.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","祖娅 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","我有点好奇……"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep4/herohub_story/14411080.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 祖娅"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","萨洛克兰可真是大变样了……"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep4/herohub_story/14411090.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","祖娅"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","欧唷，这些笼子里发条鸟儿般的艾塞勒……"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep4/herohub_story/14411130.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","祖娅"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","炮火进了它的眼连一粒灰尘都不如……"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep4/herohub_story/14411170.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","祖娅"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","嚯！这火热的空气，这欢快的烈焰！"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep4/herohub_story/14411210.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","祖娅"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","偶尔到地面上散散步，透透气，真不错嘛。"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep4/herohub_story/14411230.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","祖娅 & 因度厄"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","矮人的诅咒没解除，龙却飞走了，深岩晶也没了……"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep4/herohub_story/14411240.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","祖娅"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","坚固的雕像会崩裂倒塌，千年的诅咒有一天可能消除。"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep4/herohub_story/14411280.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","祖娅"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","呼金！你来得正好！上次你提到的新作品，拿来给我看看！"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415660.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","祖娅 & 呼金"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","今天又完成了十四次完美无缺的爆炸！"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415673.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","库露露 & 祖娅"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","这儿挺适合搞发明啊！"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415685.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","祖娅"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/cn","来喝点不含酒精的吧！"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415686.json"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/cn","祖娅"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/cn","哈！搞爆炸的家伙，看你这身架势，怎么，是想造点大动静？"],["/interaction_records/13/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415738.json"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/cn","祖娅 & 勒图姆"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/cn","赫托啊！我没看错，真的是冬喉女士！"],["/interaction_records/14/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415760.json"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/cn","祖娅 & 阿尔娜"]]}